{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40108","label":"STAR ANIS · Part 1"},"label":"First Performance: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_staranis1_prologue","next":"event_staranis1_01_e","speakers":{"anis_idol":"Anis","mint_o":"Mint","prika_o":"Prika","hanson":"Hanson"},"icons":{"anis_idol":"si_c9021_01_s","mint_o":"si_c600_00_s","prika_o":"si_c601_00_s","hanson":"si_c9023_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_1","text":"Step by step, Anis climbs the stairs,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventTitle_staranis_01","bgArt":"eventtitle_staranis_01","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_2","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_2","text":"her heart hammering in her chest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_3","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_3","text":"She glances back. Her eyes meet Mint's and Prika's.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_4","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_4","text":"Then, she looks even further.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_5","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_5","text":"Mustang is staring straight at her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_6","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_6","text":"Beyond him,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_7","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_7","text":"she sees the path she's walked.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_8","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_8","text":"Memories of her time with the Counters, of moving between the surface and the Ark, surge forward.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_9","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_9","text":"She looks even further back","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_10","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_10","text":"and suddenly, her first performance flashes before her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_11","text":"... All right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Corridor","bgArt":"corridor","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["anis_idol","mint_o","prika_o"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_12","text":"Today was our very first stage performance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_staranis_dreamsandthestage","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_13","text":"The first time we finally got to show what we'd been working on to an audience of twenty.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_14","text":"We got on stage, sang, danced, and then it was over.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_15","text":"Well, it's done for now, anyway.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_16","text":"So, what's next?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_17","text":"Time to share our thoughts on the performance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_18","text":"So, how was it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_19","text":"Hard to get fired up with such a small crowd.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_20","text":"So that's your excuse for all those mistakes?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_21","text":"They probably just thought it was cute.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_22","text":"Messing up on your first performance isn't cute. It just makes you look like an idiot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_23","text":"Hey, you're one to talk! You've messed up plenty yourself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_24","text":"Nope, I was perfect.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_25","text":"Perfect, huh? Now, who was it that shouldered me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_26","text":"You couldn't remember the formation and were just standing there like a deer in headlights, so I gave you a little nudge.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_27","text":"I wasn't just standing there! I was interacting with the fans!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_28","text":"Fans? What fans? This is our first performance. We don't have any yet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_29","text":"Better get a head start.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_30","text":"Don't make it so obvious that you don't care about the performance. If you wanted all the fame for yourself, you should've become a comedian.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_31","text":"If you're going to obsess over every last move, why didn't you just become a trainer?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_32","text":"Hey, hey, chill out, you guys!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_33","text":"I know everyone was nervous since it's our first performance. But let's not go pointing fingers at each other.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_34","text":"Sure, we messed up a little, but that's nothing we can't fix next time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_35","text":"We're a team, so cut it out with the bickering, okay?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_36","text":"Anis, have you even been practicing? Why was your singing so bad?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_37","text":"You were smiling so much it looked kind of creepy. I nearly jumped when I saw you next to me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_38","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_39","text":"You were moving really stiffly, like a marionette.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_40","text":"You were saying hi earlier, right? You weren't flipping them off or anything, were you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_41","text":"If you're going to call yourself a leader, act like one.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_42","text":"If you're unsure about your expression, just stay still. It'll at least show you're trying.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_43","text":"Y-you little...! I'm trying to be nice, and this is what I get?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_44","text":"Get some practice in, will you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_45","text":"And try slimming down a bit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_46","text":"Hey! Give credit where it's due, and call out the mistakes if you have to.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_47","text":"But who told you to just trash everyone? Ever heard of a post-mortem?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_48","text":"Are you all back at it again? You're always at each other's throats.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["hanson"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_49","text":"We're not! They started it first!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_50","text":"You're done with the talk?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_51","text":"... Yeah, all done.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_52","text":"So? What's the result?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_53","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_54","text":"Why don't we talk on the way back to the office?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_55","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_55","text":"Hanson's car glides along the empty road, its engine a quiet hum.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_staranis_01_1","bgArt":"eventscene_staranis_01_1","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_staranis_slowdrive","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_56","text":"There's not a single car out today. Feels like there have been fewer and fewer cars lately.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_57","text":"The Central Government has banned private car use.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_58","text":"Cars registered before the ban are fine, but registering a new one is practically impossible unless you're very high up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_59","text":"So you're a big shot, huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_60","text":"No way, this car was registered a long time ago.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_61","text":"Since registration is tied to the vehicle itself, cars registered today are going for astronomical prices.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_62","text":"So, how much would this go for now?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_63","text":"Hmm, I've never really thought about selling it, but it's probably worth more than ten times what it originally sold for.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_64","text":"Oh my, then if we sold this, we could get a new office, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_65","text":"I don't think so. At best, it'd cover some renovations.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_66","text":"Then sell it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"hanson","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_67","text":"No.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_68","text":"Then how about selling just one tire? That way, we'd at least be able to fix the showers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_01_s_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_idol","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_01_s_69","text":"Yeah, the water's dripping like pour-over coffee.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":nu